## 5. ECS Normalization

Wazuh's default event schema does not map cleanly to Elastic Common Schema.
For EQL `sequence by` queries to work across indices, the following fields
must be normalized:

| Wazuh field | ECS target |
|---|---|
| `data.win.eventdata.ipAddress` | `source.ip` |
| `data.win.eventdata.targetUserName` | `user.name` |
| `data.win.eventdata.subjectUserName` | `user.target.name` |
| `data.win.system.eventID` | `event.code` |
| `rule.level` | `event.severity` |
| `rule.description` | `event.action` |

Normalization is applied via an Elasticsearch ingest pipeline or a Filebeat
processor chain.

